# Self-learn edge-judge / judge-drain agent scratch that historically littered the repo root.
# The skill (skills/self-learn/references/edge-judge.md) now mandates scratch/edge-judge/ + cleanup;
# these root-anchored patterns are a belt-and-suspenders net so stray dumps never pollute git status.
/edge_*
/edgejudge_*
/ej_*
/.ej_*
/.ej-*
/judge_*
/jnext_*
/jq_*
/verdict_*
/orphan*
/*_thisrun*.json
/*_thisrun*.txt
/*_run[0-9]*.json
/*_run[0-9]*.txt
/*_dump.json
/*_dump.txt
/.tmp-*

# Internal business/strategy docs — co-located but NEVER shipped publicly
business/

# Editor backups
.cursor/*.bak

# File-drop task mint stubs (adopted into .graph on first sight; not source)
tasks/

# Frozen .graph snapshot for the isolated bench daemon (generated, large, reproducible from .graph)
bench/snapshot/

# agent-memory bench: generated artifacts (never commit)
bench/agent-memory/report.json
bench/agent-memory/report.md
bench/agent-memory/results.jsonl
bench/agent-memory/checkpoints/
